The 'movement' folder is the single shared source of truth for classifying and normalizing MUD movement/direction tokens, replacing two independently-drifted copies that used to live in useCompassBlock.ts and autoleveling-engine.ts. It exposes the corpus-verified real direction vocabulary, a classifier for outbound commands, and an exit normalizer for GMCP room_data/compass UI. Future movement-tracking work (the shared movement-attempt/succeeded/failed queue) is expected to land here too.
